            </note>
            <note corresp="#d78-f3" n="3" xml:id="d78-f3-content">
                <p>Raul Fernandes.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d78-f4" n="4" xml:id="d78-f4-content">
                <p>Getulio Dornelles Vargas, President of Brazil 1930–1945; National Senator since
                    1946.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d78-f5" n="5" xml:id="d78-f5-content">
                <p>Reference is to the Brazilian National Security Council.</p>
            </note>
